# This repository holds ONLY original course writing.
#
# The book lives inside the ECO250 teaching folder, which also contains student
# marks, exam answer keys, a copyrighted textbook, another instructor's course
# material and video transcripts. NONE of that may ever be committed here.
#
# The repository root is book/, so nothing outside it is tracked by default.
# These rules are a second line of defence in case files are copied in.

# student data -- never
*marks*.csv
*grades*.csv
grading/

# exams and answer keys -- never while a paper is still live
*KEY*.pdf
*Answer key*
EXAMS/

# third-party material -- copyrighted, not ours to redistribute
*.epub
statistics-management-economics*.pdf
BC_intro_stats/
transcripts/

# data files used in lab, which belong on Lyceum rather than here
*.dta
*.log

# build noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
*.aux
*.out
*.synctex.gz
